  "clips": [
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L001_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Один из предводителей станции «Живой архив» пригласил Мику и его спутников и начал свой рассказ.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warm narration]",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "sha256": "1f2649e915385b1636cba5515dc3120d7fbbaea4c684f50826ed9cc0efb5bf33"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L002_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Как вода?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1200,
      "sha256": "30d5b3b149a8046ac5d59d52cc3e34f78650acc59c4963334490a4ee3a415667"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L003_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Мы не случайно зовёмся фазовыми существами. Наша жизнь проходит через три состояния.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "01feaa9aadec39ebca36d553056452ebdeb27128d8c7db305c2ff21e3b72e73b"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L004_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Не совсем. Мы рождаемся в более газообразном состоянии: наши молекулы находятся далеко друг от друга.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7440,
      "sha256": "b0b0ad32cb32cec3294bd4bdb0b32df2885f439cf06b27c93e5f49672e74d310"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L005_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Со временем мы становимся плотнее, приобретаем жидкую или желеобразную форму. А в конце жизни кристаллизуемся.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8400,
      "sha256": "f7987389f6e446cfe2ae0202af74110c29bad9eb09048e2a250835518fc4bc2a"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L006_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "По одной из наших версий, мы произошли от древних космических кристаллов, встречающихся даже на астероидах.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6720,
      "sha256": "b2030e8e5d48c093ed787cfb9af35835dc0f841ec36fbb96a48f7d63e2e5164d"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L007_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Но, возможно, это и стало нашей бедой. Другие расы считают кристаллы, остающиеся после нас, такими же ценными, как добытые в космосе.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 10080,
      "sha256": "0e8bd1b883c6cfd62037b186d079ef41b93d7277f6700126c2dbe8e872ef1e32"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L008_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "А для нас это память предков.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 2640,
      "sha256": "32c48ba06c9e2765dc8a488e8db5c186e0df3865069f40db0e031fb944c20d0f"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L009_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "И я хочу поблагодарить вас за то, что вы помогли остановить ящера.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 4320,
      "sha256": "36e25edf3ba04790f4404ed48e4032a61edc3faf33b2786e49f87022e2381fed"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L010_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Хочу представить вам моего сына, принца нашего народа. Я предлагаю, чтобы он отправился вместе с вами.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6880,
      "sha256": "b1e2a4846a44676f03223f10715d8ffcaf6984291875802489b1d2a3d028acc5"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L011_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Я не могу ответить на твои вопросы о родной планете, Мика. Но помогу вам отправиться дальше — в галактику Барнарда.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "042e9bdff7250cab8becb0340bb94d76ac5ea56c478818549f272e37691495cc"
    },
    {
      "file": "ru/CH03_P04_L012_ru.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "language": "ru",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Но будь осторожен: там много пиратов!",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3280,
      "sha256": "cd9caa409a9320cfddbe122bb18edaa333e0d3d2d2504cc60a1161eac3e9878c"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L001_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "One of the leaders of the Living Archive invited Mika and his companions and began his story.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warm narration]",
      "duration_ms": 6000,
      "sha256": "ce09ee02f879eece722bd05b7317c6adf041ad5a33d8c302ab6f2f23cbc3f847"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L002_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Like water?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1440,
      "sha256": "6d55597200ae8682430f8bb69a1109ff465e571bfb0f40d6f818f7760dff4f25"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L003_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "We are not called Phase Beings by accident. Our lives pass through three states.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5600,
      "sha256": "60a01c2116a67c798b265543dbfeed7629c9d790e47b5a9dbfb342deb12612e2"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L004_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Not exactly. We are born in a more gaseous state: our molecules are far apart from one another.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "sha256": "f4267ffcc68ef1164d7ca90f0db5bc4dba52b5bf26d66086f81320882b8044dd"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L005_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Over time we grow denser and take on a liquid or jelly-like form. And at the end of life, we crystallize.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7920,
      "sha256": "80c2f5b9b296cd8f36d9bf9c21c9ef05b1f7dcce3a9b27a8bbd62ef66ef71b99"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L006_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "According to one of our theories, we descended from ancient cosmic crystals that can even be found on asteroids.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6720,
      "sha256": "e757bb66b34ea50c6f90bbd7438b9cdb7337bf77885bb6e8565c0358b160fdde"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L007_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Perhaps that became our misfortune. Other races see the crystals left after us as being just as valuable as the ones mined in space.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "3a71a0b8fd069a606dae5966d820ad73d4403c2a5261aca6a6e111106bc7358f"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L008_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "But to us, they are the memory of our ancestors.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3600,
      "sha256": "3580618b67cff29d0a53ee5b273c22f6ee2deba88a1a806c5cadc252a0345221"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L009_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "And I want to thank you for helping stop the lizard.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "55cbdaa654f58b6f738753c0b8a3ef7bff72f86a37c2c81474968f496a299700"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L010_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "I would like to introduce my son, the prince of our people. I propose that he travel with you.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6160,
      "sha256": "09c3b90188b6cd1f3a6eed7cbd168060f52849277fa736f328a061fd863189c0"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L011_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "I cannot answer your questions about your home planet, Mika. But I will help you continue onward—to the Barnard Galaxy.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "0009c429a71120b61637464cf3aa7d0b6ad2f16caaf87b705fdf53323e98dd51"
    },
    {
      "file": "en/CH03_P04_L012_en.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "language": "en",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "But be careful: there are many pirates there!",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "f8f37f88b1a23a4fbc15073111514331a0d468303c5c99f33c3a3807f4f06eb1"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L001_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Um dos líderes da estação “Arquivo Vivo” convidou Mika e seus companheiros e começou sua história.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warm narration]",
      "duration_ms": 6320,
      "sha256": "2f67bb2a6a780cf4ea9c293987b2111821544cdf123af3070ca1de4e433f4159"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L002_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Como a água?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "4c0c1d61fa57d8a35b3a62426b5814855319e92c1927ce9f5d0339602af0c082"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L003_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Não é por acaso que nos chamamos Seres de Fase. Nossa vida passa por três estados.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5520,
      "sha256": "b0329c38832068d2935d3c8ab44d12189224639e9ead1999f886e145d2654291"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L004_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Não exatamente. Nascemos em um estado mais gasoso: nossas moléculas ficam bem distantes umas das outras.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "85a31e118d1b62a4c3751572ac3f853792ca2242968938b67669ddd72f7d30e9"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L005_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Com o tempo, ficamos mais densos e adquirimos uma forma líquida ou gelatinosa. E, no fim da vida, nos cristalizamos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8960,
      "sha256": "ca7ffff34c902bfdcc2f67c91bda1b53b2bed9e26c820c0379f3549b3d54a6b7"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L006_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "De acordo com uma de nossas teorias, viemos de antigos cristais cósmicos que podem ser encontrados até em asteroides.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7360,
      "sha256": "34ea5b4486cd7b6992310a5eeffa5aaa0a3fba1e77684dfc49429a63c68ca8a6"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L007_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Talvez isso tenha se tornado nosso problema. Outras raças acreditam que os cristais que restam depois de nós têm o mesmo valor dos que são extraídos do espaço.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 9920,
      "sha256": "bb0b30d5c2ccfd0e545fd1d3121639482e2de55ead3a8ed8e7ec159c4276ea2e"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L008_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Mas, para nós, eles são a memória dos nossos antepassados.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 4640,
      "sha256": "8525f6294ded70d5e5bd2c8ac80c999bb26c65ffa584ed4be1f9a6f5f4a99c22"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L009_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "E eu quero agradecer a vocês por terem ajudado a deter o lagarto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 4160,
      "sha256": "73d9893511c902df0c900f8e807f9f58b8479a3a36ea18740c1102b390eccb39"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L010_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Quero apresentar meu filho, o príncipe do nosso povo. Proponho que ele viaje com vocês.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "9495f041f47d6b2dc256cbdaee091e1f48721193a54e83b627d9f1da1ea22a2d"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L011_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Não posso responder às suas perguntas sobre seu planeta natal, Mika. Mas vou ajudá-los a seguir adiante — para a galáxia de Barnard.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7920,
      "sha256": "2348be79eb3ff8d8111ba9ec24c99a2b255b4dce05ce0288a9235ead895c39c6"
    },
    {
      "file": "pt_BR/CH03_P04_L012_pt_BR.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "language": "pt_BR",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Mas tenha cuidado: há muitos piratas lá!",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "sha256": "8d4cf67639cacd4af9599be15abd30933f64d3ef3ae8bde87e0a0d121d0b0686"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L001_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Uno de los líderes de la estación «Archivo Viviente» invitó a Mika y a sus compañeros y comenzó su relato.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warm narration]",
      "duration_ms": 6720,
      "sha256": "bd4ea3ff583afb0c84ce3ac5c6c54a461710903ebeb212ea1414c746307a5706"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L002_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "¿Como el agua?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "30218defa4a3f25cc6e955319d8995c8fb99bbd97e88010b0529c4b276153204"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L003_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "No nos llamamos Seres de Fase por casualidad. Nuestra vida pasa por tres estados.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5440,
      "sha256": "fc0dd04a0f415f22d53c6cc25a9b4b4659cddda7fe257f92cc7a2a9e79ce8645"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L004_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "No exactamente. Nacemos en un estado más gaseoso: nuestras moléculas están muy alejadas unas de otras.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7520,
      "sha256": "908fb88cd6bf8b3a6058cdff9c4c65a19e4e4bf528cfa4944701b35e2d2a71ea"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L005_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Con el tiempo nos volvemos más densos y adoptamos una forma líquida o gelatinosa. Y al final de la vida, nos cristalizamos.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8640,
      "sha256": "88ec846661c2045aedfd54ea7392d32ac5f2f4c5afa415ef5f089b68bcc5761c"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L006_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Según una de nuestras teorías, provenimos de antiguos cristales cósmicos que incluso se encuentran en asteroides.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6960,
      "sha256": "805bea608c40454a42512f19d1d49fd26dd52093e9363a99c96e67179509fa1a"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L007_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Quizá eso se convirtió en nuestra desgracia. Otras razas consideran que los cristales que quedan después de nosotros son tan valiosos como los que extraen del espacio.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "sha256": "1f4976483d165b4b4b8cb20401be7172a748fe35a0fbcb433145fd77bb9e3e98"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L008_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Pero para nosotros, son la memoria de nuestros antepasados.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 4240,
      "sha256": "37811c7a41490a93ab24f43093d91dc87d8f2677aa28760a653d154136b64aad"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L009_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Y quiero agradecerles que hayan ayudado a detener al lagarto.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "ebc4b5e0bf8e90b953fa802210b72b8ed3c117cc1a428fb25f40a9f362b26540"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L010_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Quiero presentarles a mi hijo, el príncipe de nuestro pueblo. Propongo que viaje con ustedes.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6080,
      "sha256": "475f412c9e832043135150d63036729c25347c695aa3c4f04d4ada36861885fe"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L011_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "No puedo responder a tus preguntas sobre tu planeta natal, Mika. Pero los ayudaré a seguir adelante, hacia la galaxia de Barnard.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7760,
      "sha256": "21a063d112ac305311d425154511d3f8dceea3d1a0b6d8d3a88a276885ea105f"
    },
    {
      "file": "es/CH03_P04_L012_es.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "language": "es",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Pero ten cuidado: ¡hay muchos piratas allí!",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "sha256": "b3e2b7f4599e5c847bf5691d6e54d7f607a1f24a28b84875dafce5470513c70d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L001_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "L’un des dirigeants de la station « Archives vivantes » invita Mika et ses compagnons à entrer, puis commença son récit.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warm narration]",
      "duration_ms": 7120,
      "sha256": "ef20e2f95f04310f2e250699581f0525ed4adce74fdf3f75dcc2b67dac6d094e"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L002_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Comme l’eau ?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1040,
      "sha256": "95e0c68c33c173184c463d45ba02bc112a4f3995d653f078bff52f9ba7cac9a6"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L003_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Ce n’est pas par hasard que nous nous appelons les Êtres de Phase. Notre vie traverse trois états.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5440,
      "sha256": "4da1908c3dd2c1938cd3a85280b4529699b82236f3e0e29634fa5b275f26470f"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L004_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Pas exactement. Nous naissons dans un état plus gazeux : nos molécules sont très éloignées les unes des autres.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6400,
      "sha256": "b976335b5bec22579e64ebfa36ad5ee9f9f910a161dd1adaa25aede9dd941473"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L005_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Avec le temps, nous devenons plus denses et prenons une forme liquide ou gélatineuse. Puis, à la fin de la vie, nous nous cristallisons.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8080,
      "sha256": "7dfbaf0367187ee0b44feddd9db9a49c5c0b38a638a3cb76d48673a7f4e13475"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L006_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Selon l’une de nos théories, nous viendrions d’anciens cristaux cosmiques que l’on trouve même sur les astéroïdes.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5680,
      "sha256": "e80d18bdd00f4813e5671c2e1247009835dc724b2276592b025bcb496550b18f"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L007_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "C’est peut-être devenu notre malheur. D’autres races pensent que les cristaux laissés après nous valent autant que ceux qui sont extraits dans l’espace.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8160,
      "sha256": "752b9e574cd6b85d020cd0ecac2b28c4f976c4d44d376993752a9104a262f1c4"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L008_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Mais pour nous, ils sont la mémoire de nos ancêtres.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3440,
      "sha256": "b3fc0f8209f2d74abced52018268c0ab0a15acd74a444e604ab5890658a14787"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L009_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Et je tiens à vous remercier d’avoir aidé à arrêter le lézard.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3200,
      "sha256": "7e6b2bd083df17636e26af6cfe391e720c50dbb05469077f5c313d62d7ba4bf1"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L010_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Je voudrais vous présenter mon fils, le prince de notre peuple. Je vous propose qu’il voyage avec vous.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5840,
      "sha256": "17865b157343ce0a7133c7261645674ac3eb9ec713db60f56d369c20b01cee6d"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L011_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Je ne peux pas répondre à tes questions sur ta planète natale, Mika. Mais je vous aiderai à poursuivre votre route — vers la galaxie de Barnard.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7840,
      "sha256": "39eab88b63e6869bd9564309d82f830b64acc266103c15f646f9f4e01b140159"
    },
    {
      "file": "fr/CH03_P04_L012_fr.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "language": "fr",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Mais sois prudent : il y a beaucoup de pirates là-bas !",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3360,
      "sha256": "1f2f607f89f6bc2246e30a5bf4906258af816105909a36359e6ca5b4fe0b6a40"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L001_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L001",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 1,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_004",
      "role": "narrator",
      "kind": "narration",
      "voice_id": "JBFqnCBsd6RMkjVDRZzb",
      "text": "Einer der Anführer der Station „Lebendes Archiv“ lud Mika und seine Gefährten ein und begann seine Geschichte.",
      "emotion_tag": "[warm narration]",
      "duration_ms": 6800,
      "sha256": "8732723378fe95016d18c34de6279a92b51164aa1f0aa845e845620b150fff6f"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L002_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L002",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_015",
      "role": "professor",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4",
      "text": "Wie Wasser?",
      "emotion_tag": "[curious]",
      "duration_ms": 1280,
      "sha256": "5b39ce601713c1686b9fb2c6a3361cafa2a1736bc5082bcd11f2ba0788b852c5"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L003_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L003",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Wir heißen nicht ohne Grund Phasenwesen. Unser Leben verläuft in drei Zuständen.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 5280,
      "sha256": "1374a2e05314a4584a4dce2bcf10cc9b21b703846a28ef6caff511a50992cdb3"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L004_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L004",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 4,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Nicht ganz. Wir werden in einem eher gasförmigen Zustand geboren: Unsere Moleküle liegen weit voneinander entfernt.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7920,
      "sha256": "dd3f3311a2d8f22dbb0b1ff2c922f84ebefa64f37cff49821bd9567d021005da"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L005_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L005",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 5,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Im Laufe der Zeit werden wir dichter und nehmen eine flüssige oder geleeartige Form an. Und am Ende des Lebens kristallisieren wir aus.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8880,
      "sha256": "5165459df118f76bb195ac29dac9d756a85b69585481bb590189c6f307aa6d97"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L006_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L006",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 6,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Einer unserer Theorien zufolge stammen wir von uralten kosmischen Kristallen ab, die man sogar auf Asteroiden findet.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 7200,
      "sha256": "a8812c61ba593b0c7cb02ba00b639c814e7065e913b16abe4a47409e6ab41f55"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L007_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L007",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Vielleicht wurde genau das zu unserem Unglück. Andere Völker halten die Kristalle, die nach uns zurückbleiben, für ebenso wertvoll wie jene, die im Weltraum gewonnen werden.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 10320,
      "sha256": "edf848bcc368681ca15360fc68b8eb0d9320a03db4dd80ff34d8da921176e17e"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L008_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L008",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 8,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Für uns aber sind sie die Erinnerung an unsere Vorfahren.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3840,
      "sha256": "f91095f080ac3a33a669c0a9db84b4b624eda4ad5c214e9c3cb7bfebda0e14c5"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L009_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L009",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 9,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Und ich möchte euch dafür danken, dass ihr geholfen habt, die Echse aufzuhalten.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "sha256": "5a674727832aeb9f760871efc9733773fdfdf314490e2b6ebf6754d5e0df35ff"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L010_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L010",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 10,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Ich möchte euch meinen Sohn vorstellen, den Prinzen unseres Volkes. Ich schlage vor, dass er mit euch reist.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 6720,
      "sha256": "42be5aafe392388fc70aad25a60cc9f41daaee74a9d419733f270edefb5aa2e2"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L011_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L011",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 11,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Ich kann deine Fragen über deinen Heimatplaneten nicht beantworten, Mika. Aber ich werde euch helfen, weiterzureisen — in die Barnard-Galaxie.",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 8480,
      "sha256": "d6a51fb01432516c7b65b1acc701c4c1ec7ec102e592a787a7a7aea2ba30ba79"
    },
    {
      "file": "de/CH03_P04_L012_de.mp3",
      "line_id": "CH03_P04_L012",
      "language": "de",
      "reading_order": 12,
      "speaker_id": "CHR_028",
      "role": "phase_archive_leader",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "voice_id": "cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal",
      "text": "Aber sei vorsichtig: Dort gibt es viele Piraten!",
      "emotion_tag": "[calm, wise]",
      "duration_ms": 3680,
      "sha256": "dd4db8a903ca488a4107476d35963706e7c3da71064504adfe2aaf484f3b1dc6"
    }
  ]
}
